   "label_text": "Work Notes",
   "text": "\"work_notes\": \"2024-07-16 10:00: Dev - Reproduced: CTASK stayed open after the SolMan CD reached 'Confirmed'.\\n2024-07-16 14:00: Dev - Reviewed Business Rule 'SolMan: Sync CD State to CTASK Closure Readiness'; confirmed it runs Before update with condition u_cd_state.changesTo() == true.\\n2024-07-16 16:00: Dev - Executed Fix Script 'SolMan: Fix CD State Inconsistencies' in non-prod as a one-time Scheduled Script Execution; verified the log counts.\\n2024-07-16 17:00: Dev - Confirmed sibling CTASKs auto-close (state=3) only when every sibling CTASK has a terminal CD state.\"",
